NyxstoneTricoreGCC is licensed under the GNU General Public License version
3.0 or any later version (GPL-3.0-or-later).

The library statically links GNU assembler (gas) object files from binutils, including `tc-tricore.o`, `read.o`, `write.o`, `cond.o`, and the gas core, together with `libbfd` and `libopcodes`.  gas is GPL-3.0-or-later, which
propagates to any binary distribution of this library.  libbfd and
libopcodes are LGPL-3.0-or-later, which is compatible with (and absorbed by)
the GPL-3.0-or-later term.

Full GPL-3.0 text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

